# Ignore rules for the web image. The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT
# (docker build -f apps/web-angular/Dockerfile .), so BuildKit reads the copy of this file
# named `Dockerfile.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile. Keep both files identical.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log

# Other applications and infrastructure are not needed for the web image.
apps/api
apps/ml
apps/mobile
infrastructure
docs
.github
packages/shared-types
